MerkleAdapterDeallocate
├── when no liquidity has been released
│   ├── it returns zero even when NAV arithmetic overflows or the report is delayed
│   ├── it rejects an unavailable underlying balance read while staging cash
│   └── it cannot bypass the delegator's final NAV validation
└── when liquidity has been released
    ├── it still rejects NAV arithmetic overflow
    ├── it rejects an unavailable underlying balance read before paying released liquidity
    ├── it still rejects NAV arithmetic overflow when the requested return is zero
    └── it rejects an unavailable cash read even when the requested return is zero
